# Allowlist: the image only needs the package and its metadata. Everything
# else - virtual environments, test data, caches, git history, local data
# directories and .env files with secrets - stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!docushelf/

# Never part of the image, even inside the package directory
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
